# C-c preparation driver static review brief

Review the frozen driver produced under `campaign-preparation-driver/` against the original transition C-c requirements, `fresh-preparation-inventory.md`, the admission design, and final source/readiness authorities. This is preparation-only code. No execution of the driver or repository modules belongs to review. Source-only read/AST/diff/hash, Ruff and in-memory compilation are allowed; no tests may be read, created, modified or run.

## Gate and write scope

Before any source import or artifact/resource write, the driver must authenticate the actual fixed final source approval, its 22-file source authority, the actual readiness approval, and the caller's exact reviewed selections. It must fail on mismatches, preexisting destination roots or unsafe/overlapping paths. All fresh destinations stay inside the authorized main repository; source is the existing architecture worktree and mounted resource roots are disjoint outside that source tree. Existing archives, production sources and mutable old resource roots are untouched. No deletion, overwrite, historical enrollment, state migration or recovery is permitted.

## Exact native preparation

Authenticate original actual06's graph and the precise fixed dependencies/provenance from the inventory. Import only the 14 existing dependency files and nine exact parent-provenance files; no old manifest/scope/config/owner/roles/ledger/request/checkpoint/reservation/start state. Preserve each original dependency ref and exact raw bytes. Capture the real four immutable policy blobs via the native read-only Git helper at commit0985d9bae74162ec1da8a7268bd54e47f21b0b85. Use direct native manifest building, native preparation with a fresh real owner/config, and the new immutable prepared policy artifact. No binding/enrollment, launch, start, paid reservation or provider/evaluation execution may occur.

Native adapter construction is allowed for this genuine fresh preparation, as the accepted inventory specifies; the ban on constructing operational adapters applies to historical verification. Credentials must remain lazy and unread. No fake capability/dependency/request object may stand in for the native preparation/factory. The actual initial empty projection is legitimate only after fresh repository emptiness is established. Use normal factory/reducer/parent selection and actual investigator request construction; save preview bytes outside roles/state and check the real request against the prepared policy's pure envelope predicate. Do not append it to role request history or manufacture any later response-dependent packet.

